{
  "name": "WF13 - REST API Wrapper (AI-ERP)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF13 — Webhook יחיד ל-Frontend\n\nמקבל POST עם `{action, table, payload}` (או `{action:\"chat\", message}`).\n\n**לפני שמריצים:**\n1. הכניסו ל-Code node הבא (Validate & Prepare) את ה-Base ID האמיתי שלכם\n2. צרו Credential מסוג HTTP Header Auth: Name=`Authorization`, Value=`Bearer <YOUR_AIRTABLE_PAT>`\n3. חברו את ה-Credential לכל שלושת ה-HTTP Request nodes (List/Create/Update)\n4. ה-Webhook Production URL (אחרי Activate) הוא מה שמכניסים בהגדרות ה-frontend",
        "height": 244,
        "width": 588
      },
      "id": "a41a716e-73f0-4af2-aeaf-cc4713e09220",
      "name": "הוראות התקנה",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -832,
        -224
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**CORS**: אם ה-frontend רץ בדפדפן, בקשות עם Content-Type: application/json שולחות קודם preflight OPTIONS. * ייתכן שתצטרכו Webhook נוסף על אותו path עם method=OPTIONS שמחזיר מיד 200 + אותם headers — תלוי בגרסת n8n שלכם.",
        "height": 336,
        "width": 496
      },
      "id": "f658a424-5f7f-4a84-a044-f732685e496a",
      "name": "הערת CORS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -208,
        -224
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "wf13-erp",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "allowedOrigins": "*"
        }
      },
      "id": "8ae05677-d9c9-4c07-af4f-11b4e142beda",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -656,
        512
      ],
      "webhookId": "wf13-erp"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const ALLOWED_TABLES = ['Invoices','Leads','Products','Tasks'];\nconst ALLOWED_ACTIONS = ['list','create','update','chat'];\nconst BASE_ID = 'appdB6Amrw3JWFCUH'; \n\nconst body = $json.body || $json || {};\nconst action = body.action;\nconst table = body.table;\nconst payload = body.payload || {};\n\nif (!ALLOWED_ACTIONS.includes(action)) {\n  return [{ json: { valid:false, errorMessage:`action לא חוקי: ${action}` } }];\n}\nif (action !== 'chat' && !ALLOWED_TABLES.includes(table)) {\n  return [{ json: { valid:false, errorMessage:`table לא חוקי: ${table}` } }];\n}\n\nlet outUrl = '';\nlet method = 'GET';\nlet outBody = {};\n\nif (action === 'list') {\n  method = 'GET';\n  outUrl = `https://api.airtable.com/v0/${BASE_ID}/${encodeURIComponent(table)}`;\n}\n\nif (action === 'create') {\n  method = 'POST';\n  outUrl = `https://api.airtable.com/v0/${BASE_ID}/${encodeURIComponent(table)}`;\n  const fields = payload.fields ? { ...payload.fields } : { ...payload };\n  // * חישוב מע\"מ 18% אוטומטי בעת יצירת חשבונית\n  if (table === 'Invoices' && fields.Amount !== undefined) {\n    const amount = Number(fields.Amount) || 0;\n    fields.VatAmount = Math.round(amount * 0.18 * 100) / 100;\n    fields.Total = Math.round(amount * 1.18 * 100) / 100;\n  }\n  outBody = { fields };\n}\n\nif (action === 'update') {\n  method = 'PATCH';\n  const recId = payload.id;\n  if (!recId) {\n    return [{ json: { valid:false, errorMessage:'update דורש payload.id' } }];\n  }\n  outUrl = `https://api.airtable.com/v0/${BASE_ID}/${encodeURIComponent(table)}/${recId}`;\n  outBody = { fields: payload.fields || {} };\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: { valid:true, action, table, method, url: outUrl, body: outBody, chatMessage: body.message }\n}];"
      },
